    "Breakpoint-section observations;not uninterrupted scanout.",
    "13.728ms timer quantization;individual frame/section values include phase uncertainty.",
    "Original-only workload localization;no port timing correction or browser acceptance.",
    "Adding four stops per frame changes this run to54 resident counts,versus44 in the earlier four-stop profile. Do not use either as uninterrupted cadence.",
    "Cached PIC status has up to one normal-core millisecond of phase lag;negative initial duration is retained and only differences are meaningful.",
    "Sprite work counts exclude interrupts,other game logic and budget-end I/O clamping. Not wired into browser scheduling.",
    "The retained legacy mountain-timing summary labels observedInputBoundaries as4 and repeats the ignore-count scope. The profile/raw states independently prove15 measured reads plus2 cleanup reads;future producer metadata is corrected. No retained capture was edited."
